⚡️ 🇺🇸 The U.S under the Trump Administration has now revoked more visas in the last 18 months than the last 18 years combined.

Over the last 18mo, 175,000 visas were revoked, compared to the last 18 years which totaled 122,000 combined and the numbers are continuing to climb daily.

